{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"f75140a862f9de201e08e56a40c379051cfc0d487dc66c626f47283da3dc5a20","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"fdf8fb0bf7e0817d4a23d2ad4d660fbd9f67d1d8b4d2e7a2cdc5c081f82f522b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The translation adds a sentence the source does not have: 「即使效果提前解除，幼虫仍可能以较低强度破体而出并生成幼虫」 (\"even if the effect ends early, larvae may still burst out at lower strength and spawn larvae\"). The source text, tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:340 (long_desc), only says that each larva bursts out after the gestation period and deals %0.2f physical and %0.2f fire damage. Its format arguments (lines 341-343) contain nothing about early removal, reduced strength, or spawning. The DLC source is unpinned and the envelope gives no checkout location, so any on_remove mechanic cannot be checked here. This is added content, not a translation, and it should be removed. The translation also drops \"feeding on it\" and \"developing\", and it calls the victim 寄主 in one place and 宿主 in another."},{"revision_key":"fe6aea82cf87957b020a937c1c7fd190f41e59cd90bc0471bf857936d5c3c413","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says \"Kaltor's orders are to consider you a customer for now\", but the translation 「卡托尔的指令让我们将你视为顾客」 drops \"for now\" (暂时). The guard is saying the customer status is temporary and conditional, which sets up the threat in the next sentence (\"Try anything foolish...\"). Without \"for now\", the line becomes an unconditional statement. Suggest restoring it with 「暂时」."},{"revision_key":"feb159a7c4526cac0a361f1329962ee505a37ac0d01bd670212413392deb61ab","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fee2307e3c1871b2d34c3028ca76bb0a30aff8919f8a128dc6ce8a34fb55a5c5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fef7f1c8a7bd4fa1979842eec96599e04e50daeae6f2f2d43bf0d5a6fd5370eb","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ff03daa8a279f3d4eb39d7f0a7aaadb0c2817fab4b7cadd63340f2d1e40a39c4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The ending changes meaning. The source \"you can not allow anything to take it away again!\" is an order to the player: you must not let anything take the Prides' freedom away again. The translation 「任何人都无法再次夺走它」 says that no one is able to take it away, which turns the order into a claim that it cannot happen. That weakens the reason for the quest. It also narrows \"anything\" to 任何人 (\"anyone\"). Suggest something like 「你绝不能让任何事物再次将其夺走」 (\"you must never let anything take it away again\")."},{"revision_key":"ff110b738aafe8ded4579f8e1237f63009404226bb06811ec011e16e4bec6014","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ff22e159c34f0ffceda0f3b6a56cdef664d2bea4d7a258b03f9121a0122508c7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"Mistranslation of \"Essentials\". In the item name \"Qog's Essentials\" it means necessities or everyday kit, not \"essence\". The source (tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:1156-1160) defines the item as BASE_TOOL_MISC with unided_name \"strange injector\" and subtype \"injector\", so it is a tool or kit. The translation 精华 means \"essence/extract\". Suggest 「寇格的必需品」 or 「寇格随身必备」."}]}